{"title":"1991 USAMO Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/b/1abc86b2aca281aec42fedd24ffc5169bde043f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\, a =\\frac{m^{m+1} + n^{n+1}}{m^m + n^n}, \\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"155\" height=\"42\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/e/79efff89a20256890f8df5f78a0e7dece4e6fc2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\,m\\,$\" width=\"18\" height=\"8\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/e/4fee812027e63ab97b131883add2595b9783edd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\,n\\,$\" width=\"13\" height=\"8\" /> are positive integers.  Prove that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d690349cb95efedb981190982805d6f603696ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\,a^m + a^n \\geq m^m + n^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"160\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>[You may wish to analyze the ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/5/e9506d9aa1ba43c40c89ee23bca1238af7334d8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\,\\frac{a^N - N^N}{a-N},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"88\" height=\"43\" /> for real <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/652cfa7dcf99220b46a7c6060549139e563e1ec4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\, a \\geq 0 \\,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"45\" height=\"15\" /> and integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/5/b355efbe8469af1662d6bb12e8340bd34e1c020a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\, N \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"55\" height=\"17\" />.]\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let us assume without loss of generality that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/3/9b343d21c3c8cdea3ca14a56343d23ea7ec8a6b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m\\ge n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"50\" height=\"14\" />.  We then note that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/c/bbc03cc4b825f2ea67970af098201732b65bfceb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[m-a = \\frac{m^{m+1} + m \\cdot n^n}{m^m+n^n} - \\frac{m^{m+1} - n^{n+1}}{m^m+n^n} = n^n \\frac{m-n}{m^m+n^n} \\qquad (*) .\\]\" width=\"485\" height=\"40\" />\nSimilarly,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/6/dd61876435249a1d13c5525267c0b6567cb9eecb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a-n = m^m \\frac{m-n}{m^m+n^n} \\qquad (**) .\\]\" width=\"238\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p>We note that equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d02e715e7f7195675151570530c5b62ba7b2744.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(*)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add9aecc4400c0721e215cecc4c2be5c4b18313e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(**)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"34\" height=\"20\" /> imply that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb8de31e0be3640ce8efa3e813264dc850251f1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\le a \\le m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"14\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/f/bbf6238bff8ba2f66b324c1899ed3e71023d69c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a/m \\le 1 \\le a/n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/e/3fe72fd45c4467a873d1477b1822ce697a038138.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{m} \\sum_{i=0}^{m-1} (a/m)^i \\le 1 \\le \\frac{1}{n} \\sum_{i=0}^{n-1} (a/n)^i .\\]\" width=\"258\" height=\"50\" />\nMultiplying this inequality by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/b/39bb5ca9ec7c867e314d2c4bc44fb041a795e87f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^m n^n(m-n)/(m^m+n^n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"204\" height=\"18\" />, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/7/567be9f8c8c13a07610c834771c4ebec92eebd8a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[n^n \\frac{(m-n)}{m^m+n^n} \\sum_{i=0}^{m-1} a^i m^{m-1-i} \\le m^m \\frac{(m-n)}{m^m+n^n} \\sum_{i=0}^{n-1} a^i n^{n-1-i} .\\]\" width=\"435\" height=\"50\" />\nIt then follows that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b3057cc34c53caabf2b041558c9e96b055a7da12.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} m^m - a^m &amp;= (m-a) \\sum_{i=0}^{m-1} a^i m^{m-1-i} = n^n \\frac{m-n}{m^m+n^n} \\sum_{i=0}^{m-1} a^i m^{m-1-i} \\\\ &amp;\\le m^m \\frac{m-n}{m^m+n^n} \\sum_{i=0}^{n-1} a^i n^{n-1-i} = (a-n) \\sum_{i=0}^{n-1} a^i n^{n-1-i} \\\\ &amp;= a^n - n^n . \\end{align*}\" width=\"498\" height=\"133\" />\nRearranging this inequality, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/5/ad5223d39f42f1edb0b1ab1eb23ff87024e9031d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^m + a^n \\ge m^m + n^n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"160\" height=\"17\" />, as desired.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/b/3bbb9e25e5be095e317771a9c5d00877ee9c8012.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\blacksquare$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1991_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_USAMO\" title=\"1991 USAMO\">1991 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"1991 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=1991\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1991 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1991 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1991 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1991 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1991 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1991 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?p=344949#344949\">Discussion on AoPS/MathLinks</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017182917\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.067 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 149/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1617/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4111/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   17.081      1 -total\n 38.55%    6.585      1 Template:USAMO_box\n 31.21%    5.331      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n 28.67%    4.898      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6272:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017182917 and revision id 235255. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}